==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Angel]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Winged Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Lutrinae Gokurakko]] spawns after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the first Metal Doge with any critter, then stall out the initial wave of enemies until your Cat Cannon charges up. This will clear the field of everybody except for the remaining Metal Doge. At this point, just stall him with any [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] while you slowly upgrade your wallet.

Once you're ready, start sending out a steady line of [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cats]], alongside whatever other slow attackers you want to bring (e.g., [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Master of Selection Darvin (Special Cat)|Master of Selection Clawvin]], [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]], etc.). Once your units are about to reach the enemy base, send out [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Ideally, Bahamut triggers the boss wave and starts eating chunks out of Cruel Angel Clionel's HP, Cat Researcher then comes in and ''hopefully'' saves Bahamut from the Metal Doge that would otherwise kill him. He'll usually die to Lutrinae Gokurakko afterwards, but not without taking some of Clionel's life insurance as compensation.

After Awakened Bahamut Cat dies, wait until Shadow Boxer K appears, then use the Cat Cannon to instantly kill her and heavily cripple Winged Pigge. It shouldn't be too difficult to hold your ground with Shadow Boxer K out of the way, but you still need to pray on good Cat Researcher Critical Hit RNG to prevent Metal Doges from causing too much havoc. [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] is recommended regardless, being immune to each of the enemies' status effects. It's just a waiting game now: cycle out another Cat Cannon to finish off Clionel and Winged Pigge, then repeat the process for the second Winged Pigge and Gokurakko. Once they're dead, you've won.

